5b-58ae-8fd5-aff3425b7d6b" :question/math-academy-id "q-10049" :question/problem "${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "In this case, we use the double-angle formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡2\\theta =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,⇒\\,\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2\\theta =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\n \n\nLetting $\\theta =4x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡8x & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡8x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{16}\\operatorname{cos}⁡8x{|}_{0}^{\\pi /4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{16}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\pi -\\operatorname{cos}⁡0) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{16}(1-1) \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-10049/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c4c5541e-8195-53de-b604-e622c3b6a2e7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-10049"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114600/selection/ce8d95d1d61adcac30bdd85a5db2cddca2ec82e06c8aa4275bd6fca4580f8f6c" :answer/id #uuid "addb0da7-e313-5a86-a7b2-2c7da07e3afc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}+\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114600/selection/91e0cabc74ea963331f5e4921818bb06bf1e272363a24152972f791c08e64daa" :answer/id #uuid "2ad823bf-3426-5fa9-bca1-e4287658a589" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{2}-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114600/selection/bc58c008a42c5c8b71532ce99be3f674c50c2645555a3c9a4b3ca4b7f71afb34" :answer/id #uuid "e25b4bbc-57f8-5b7a-9683-